2. Configure R1 and R2's serial interfaces. Clock rate must be 128000.

R1
---
conf t
int s0/0
ip address 50.0.0.1 255.255.255.0
no shut
exit

int f1/0
ip address 10.10.20.1 255.255.255.252
no shut
exit

int f0/0
ip address 10.10.10.1 255.255.255.252
no shut
exit

R2
----
conf t
int s0/0
ip address 50.0.0.2 255.255.255.0
clock rate 128000
no shut
exit



VERIFY
sh ip int br
sh int s0/0
sh run | section interface Serial0/0

==========================================================================================================
4. Configure sub-interfaces on R2's f0/0 interface. f0/0.1 must be a member of Vlan 1,
f0/0.10 must be a member of vlan 10.

- Router on a Stick - ROAS -

R2
----
conf t
int f0/0
no ip address
no shut
exit

! VLAN 10 -IT
int f0/0.10
encapsulation dot1q 10
ip address 172.16.10.1 255.255.255.0
no shut
exit

! VLAN 50 - MANAGEMENT VLAN
int f0/0.50
encapsulation dot1q 50
ip address 172.16.50.1 255.255.255.0
no shut
exit

! VERIFY
sh ip int br


