8. Propagate vlans on SW1, SW2 and SW3 using VTP. L3S1 must be configured as server, all remaining
switches must be vtp clients. Use the domain name "mnet", and password "cisco".


@L3S1
-----
conf t
vtp mode server
vtp version 2
vtp domain mnet
vtp password cisco
exit


